    "Name": "Drogon DG2 – Evidence Package",
    "Description": "Top-level evidence package for DG2 Concept Select. Organises all supporting artifacts into domain-specific sub-collections: Geomodel (grid + maps + polygons), Seismic (BinGrid + TraceData far/near + OpenVDS), Wells & Stratigraphy (wells + markers + litho column), Simulation & Volumes (FMU + forecast + tables), and Documents (SRA, CRA, PDO, PTR). Also directly references risks, activity chain, DevelopmentConcept, reservoir master-data, and GeoLabelSet. 165 total artifacts across 5 sub-collections.",
